          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "The four drafts develop ways to represent and approximate the same Newman flow. The key distinction for our discussion is whether a result improves representation, gives usable error bounds, or adds information about zeros; those are separate achievements. The chat recorder also rejected an unfamiliar message format, so I’m checking that before claiming the history is saved.\n"
            ]
